  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training young diplomats in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to train (maximum 20) junior diplomats from Jordan in all content and competences needed, to make a start in their new career and to operate effectively in international and politically sensitive environments.The aim of this training is for participants to perceive foreign policy as an opportunity for cooperation and as a basis upon which to build the foundation for a working partnership on global matters.The training should contribute to securing future dialogue on key societal challenges and to strengthen bilateral relations with the Jordanian Ministry of Foreign Affairs (MFA).</narrative>
  </description>
